# Start: the systems page, focus on its first system row, NO SYSTEM TICKED
# (see run-transfer.steps for why). End: the CLOUD hub. Like run-transfer
# but a frame every three seconds for a minute, so every phase of a run
# with settings, saves and several systems is caught on the page (#95).
key up
wait 1
key right
wait 1
key x
wait 1
shot selected-all
key right
wait 1
key x
wait 2
shot t02
wait 3
shot t05
wait 3
shot t08
wait 3
shot t11
wait 3
shot t14
wait 3
shot t17
wait 3
shot t20
wait 3
shot t23
wait 3
shot t26
wait 3
shot t29
wait 3
shot t32
wait 4
shot t36
wait 4
shot t40
wait 5
shot t45
wait 5
shot t50
wait 10
shot t60
key x
wait 2
